ns Rather Than Data?","src":"Kalkine","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-26","zh":"為什麼禮來公司（NYSE：LLY）、Moderna（納斯達克股票代碼：MRNA）和Corcept Therapeutics（納斯達克股票代碼：CORT）根據預期而非數據進行交易？"},{"title":"Tango builds on Revolution Medicines’ pancreatic cancer success","src":"STAT","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxOUFRubkRfZTA2MWRmWk10YlNFRWdOUXB6VTJodjZDOFBvd19SNm9hcGwwY0pMQW5HeTFSWEp4Nm1LVm10aG1pRElkTmppUlpyTXJmUnZsWi1mRTJ6R01FbEgxVTJOOVVFU2dheHlETWY4SGxpeE1UZHhIT1VMaHZCTXJCRHNJb0FtWF85bF9Mc291R2M2MXFv?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"Tango 建立在 Revolution Medicines 胰臟癌成功的基礎上"},{"title":"Tempus AI: Moderna's New Cancer Vaccine Partner Is The Pick Of The AI Biotech Bunch","src":"Seeking Alpha","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPaS00LVN6TGVYLUptMUdlbnR3UHktM2ZXMC0tV1l5aHdYY0Raanhfd2xRVmRVWmtudExwclhUeUh3Xzk1dG9CVlRKOG9xS1VucVVOcU1jWjlKcG1QcUlXbFpnTkZjSGR2bVZDQzR6dXRyOFcwYnpPczFaZDdCUXFPZ0VnWWNISHVVRXdodG5SbEcwRERsU3JuSG5IMVFyZDJaM0xlSG96SXVVZy0tam1WaTdvdGhLdUpaVlRWSG5aOA?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"Tempus AI：Moderna 的新癌症疫苗合作夥伴是人工智慧生物技術領域的最佳選擇"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":1},{"name":"關稅/貿易","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-20","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1682852/000168285226000033/mrna-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Moderna is a pioneer and leader in the field of mRNA medicine. Through the advancement of our technology platform, we are reimagining how medicines are made to transform how we treat and prevent diseases. Since our founding, our mRNA platform has enabled the development of vaccine and therapeutic candidates across infectious disease, oncology, rare disease and more.","zh":"Moderna是mRNA醫學領域的先驅和領導者。透過科技平台的進步，我們正在重新構想藥物的製造方式，以改變我們治療和預防疾病的方式。自成立以來，我們的 mRNA 平台已協助開發傳染病、腫瘤學、罕見疾病等領域的疫苗和候選治療藥物。"},{"en":"With a global team and a unique culture, driven by our values and mindsets, our mission is to deliver the greatest possible impact to people through mRNA medicines.","zh":"憑藉我們的價值觀和思維方式驅動的全球團隊和獨特的文化，我們的使命是透過 mRNA 藥物為人們帶來最大的影響。"},{"en":"We currently have three commercial products—Spikevax and mNEXSPIKE (our COVID vaccines) and mRESVIA (our vaccine against respiratory syncytial virus (RSV)). mNEXSPIKE, which we launched commercially in the third quarter of 2025, is now our leading product in the U.S. retail channel. In 2025, we achieved total revenue of $1.9 billion, largely from sales of our COVID vaccines.","zh":"我們目前有三種商業產品——Spikevax 和 mNEXSPIKE（我們的新冠疫苗）以及 mRESVIA（我們的呼吸道合胞病毒 (RSV) 疫苗）。 mNEXSPIKE 於 2025 年第三季投入商業運營，目前是我們在美國零售通路的主導產品。 2025 年，我們實現了 19 億美元的總收入，主要來自新冠疫苗的銷售。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We have multiple patent families spanning different levels of breadth, design and antigen valency pending in the U.S., Europe and around the world, including several granted patents.","zh":"我們在美國、歐洲和世界各地擁有多個涵蓋不同廣度、設計和抗原價水平的專利系列，其中包括幾項已授予的專利。"},{"en":"Human metapneumovirus (hMPV) is a single-stranded RNA virus that is used in a combination program. We have patent applications covering our hMPV vaccine pending in the U.S. and Europe, with a granted patent in the U.S.","zh":"人類偏肺病毒 (hMPV) 是一種單股 RNA 病毒，用於組合程序。我們正在美國和歐洲申請有關 hMPV 疫苗的專利申請，並已在美國獲得授權。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The biotechnology and pharmaceutical industries utilize rapidly advancing technologies and are characterized by intense competition. There is also a strong emphasis on defense of intellectual property and proprietary products.","zh":"生物技術和製藥業利用快速發展的技術，具有競爭激烈的特性。也非常重視智慧財產權和專有產品的保護。"},{"en":"We believe that mRNA as a medicine coupled with our capabilities across mRNA technology, drug discovery, development and manufacturing provide us with a competitive advantage. However, we face competition from others developing mRNA medicines, as well as other medicines that compete or could compete with our products. We face competition from various sources, including large pharmaceutical companies, biotechnology companies, academic institutions, government agencies and public and private research institutions. The continued growth of the mRNA field is leading to increased competitive pressure, including from large and more established pharmaceutical companies. We also face competition when entering into strategic alliances to advance and grow our pipeline.","zh":"我們相信，mRNA 作為一種藥物，加上我們在 mRNA 技術、藥物發現、開發和製造方面的能力，為我們提供了競爭優勢。然而，我們面臨著其他開發 mRNA 藥物的競爭，以及其他與我們的產品競爭或可能競爭的藥物的競爭。我們面臨來自各種來源的競爭，包括大型製藥公司、生物技術公司、學術機構、政府機構以及公共和私人研究機構。 mRNA 領域的持續成長導致競爭壓力加大，其中包括來自大型且成熟的製藥公司的競爭壓力。在建立策略聯盟以推進和擴大我們的產品線時，我們也面臨著競爭。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Product Sales","val":1818000000,"zh":"產品銷售"},{"name":"COVID19","val":1810000000,"zh":"新冠肺炎"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":126000000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"},{"name":"Stand Ready Manufacturing Revenue","val":80000000,"zh":"隨時準備製造收入"},{"name":"Grant","val":22000000,"zh":"授予"},{"name":"Collaboration Arrangement Including Arrangements With Affiliate","val":13000000,"zh":"合作安排，包括與附屬機構的安排"},{"name":"License & Royalty","val":11000000,"zh":"許可證和版稅"},{"name":"RSV","val":8000000,"zh":"RSV"}],"total":1944000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":1199000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Rest Of World","val":692000000,"zh":"世界其他地區"},{"name":"Europe","val":53000000,"zh":"歐洲"}],"total":1944000000}},"peers":["NVAX","BNTX","ZM","NIO","PFE"]}}